{greeting}

When a roof comes up on a listing, you need an answer in writing before it stalls the deal. That is the whole point of our realtor partner program - free pre-listing inspections, reports inside your deadlines, and itemized estimates when an inspector flags something.

The details are here: {offer_link}

Want me on your list for the next one?

{greeting}

When a tenant calls about a leak, you need someone on site fast and a report you can forward to the owner as-is. That is what our preferred-vendor program is built around: 24-hour response, owner-ready documentation on every job, and pricing agreed up front.

The details: {offer_link}

Would it help to have us on your vendor list?

{greeting}

Boards get asked how long the roofs have left, usually right before a special assessment. Our Community Shield program starts with a free roof condition report for the community - every building photographed, with a remaining-life estimate - and keeps it current every year.

The details: {offer_link}

Would that be useful to your board this year?

{greeting}

Most roof budgets get set after the leak. A free condition assessment - photos and a remaining-life estimate - lets you set it before. If you'd like it handled from there, we keep the building on a maintenance schedule.

The details: {offer_link}

Who is the right person to set up a walk-through with?

{greeting}

Home Shield is one monthly plan that keeps the outside of your home looked after: an annual roof inspection with photos, priority response after hail, and a discount on repairs.

The details: {offer_link}

Want me to walk you through it?

{greeting}

After hail, the roofer your client picks decides whether their claim goes smoothly. We inspect honestly, document properly for the adjuster, and tell people plainly when there's no claim - which keeps everyone's loss history clean.

The details: {offer_link}

Could we be one of the names you give clients?

{greeting}

With the recent storms around {city}, a reminder: as one of our customers, your roof check after any hail is free. It takes about 20 minutes and you get photos of anything we find.

The details: {offer_link}

Reply with a day that works and I'll set it up.

{greeting}

Now that your roof is done, Home Shield keeps it - and the rest of the exterior - on a schedule: an annual inspection with photos, priority response after hail, and savings on repairs. As a roof customer you also get [AMOUNT] when you join.

The details: {offer_link}

Want me to set it up?

{greeting}

Most of our work comes from customers like you telling a neighbor. If you know someone with roof trouble, send them our way - and when their project is signed, we'll send you [AMOUNT] as a thank-you.

The details: {offer_link}

Thanks for trusting us with your home.

{greeting}

Thanks again for trusting us with your roof. We also do siding, windows, paint, decks and gutters, and as a past customer you get [AMOUNT] on your next project.

